  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05187-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategy contextRef="FilingDateInstant">「中期経営計画2024-2026」https://scalagrp.jp/pdf/ir/release/midtermplan_20230814s.pdf38ページ</jpcrp030000-asr_E05187-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategy>
